<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-ALGERIA BEAT IVORY COAST 4-1 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ALGERIA BEAT IVORY COAST 4-1 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria beat Ivory Coast 4-1</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in an African Nations Cup soccer qualifier on</p>
<p>Sunday in Algiers.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Algeria - Mesabah (7th, 69th mins), Moussa Saib  (41st,</p>
<p>89th)</p>
<p>Ivory Coast - Joel Tiehi (71st)</p>
</text>
